vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Submit Volunteer Registration
  
  Registers a new volunteer with the Cedarrise Initiative. Accepts a JSON body containing the volunteer's personal details, areas of interest, skills, and availability preferences.
  
  On success, the volunteer record is saved to the database and the endpoint returns the newly created object with a `201 Created` status.
  
  ## Authorization
  No authentication is required for this endpoint (public form submission).
  
  ## Request Body (`application/json`)
  
  ### Personal Details
  
  | Field             | Type    | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                                              |
  |-------------------|---------|----------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | firstName         | string  | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                            |
  | middleName        | string  | No       | Optional text                                                                                             |
  | surname           | string  | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                            |
  | gender            | string  | Yes      | One of: `MALE`, `FEMALE`                                                                                  |
  | dob               | date    | Yes      | ISO date string — `YYYY-MM-DD` format                                                                     |
  | age               | number  | Yes      | Integer, minimum `16`                                                                                     |
  | phoneNumber       | string  | Yes      | Non-empty phone number                                                                                    |
  | emailAddress      | string  | Yes      | Valid email address                                                                                       |
  | homeAddress       | string  | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                            |
  | city              | string  | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                            |
  | state             | string  | Yes      | Valid Nigerian state (e.g. `LAGOS`, `ABIA`, `FCT`)                                                        |
  | occupation        | string  | No       | Optional text                                                                                             |
  | highestEducation  | string  | No       | One of: `SECONDARY SCHOOL`, `DIPLOMA / CERTIFICATE`, `UNDERGRADUATE`, `POSTGRADUATE`, `OTHER` (optional) |
  
  ### Volunteer Preferences
  
  | Field                  | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                                             |
  |------------------------|--------|----------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | reasonForVolunteering  | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                           |
  | volunteerAreas         | array  | Yes      | Array of: `ASH`, `TACOTS`, `CAPACITY BUILDING`, `CEDAR OUTREACHES`, `ADMINISTRATIVE SUPPORT`            |
  | skillsToContribute     | array  | No       | Array of: `TEACHING`, `MENTORING`, `PUBLIC SPEAKING`, `CREATIVE ARTS`, `DIGITAL / ICT`, `WRITING`, `PROJECT COORDINATION`, `COMMUNITY MOBILIZATION`, `ADMIN`, `GRAPHICS DESIGN`, `PHOTOGRAPHY / VIDEOGRAPHY`, `SOCIAL MEDIA`, `DATA MANAGEMENT`, `OTHER` (optional) |
  | availability           | array  | Yes      | Array of: `WEEKDAYS`, `WEEKENDS`, `OCCASIONAL EVENTS`, `FLEXIBLE`                                       |
  | commitmentDuration     | string | No       | One of: `3 MONTHS`, `6 MONTHS`, `1 YEAR`, `MORE THAN 1 YEAR` (optional)                                 |
  
  ### ASH-Specific Preferences
  
  | Field                    | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                                                  |
  |--------------------------|--------|----------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | ashSaturdayAvailability  | string | No       | One of: `EVERY SATURDAY`, `TWO SATURDAYS A MONTH`, `ONE SATURDAY A MONTH`, `OCCASIONALLY` (optional)         |
  | ashAcademicArea          | string | No       | One of: `LITERACY (READING & WRITING)`, `NUMERACY (MATHEMATICS)`, `BOTH` (optional)                          |
  | ashExtracurricular       | array  | No       | Array of: `DRAMA / THEATRE`, `MUSIC / SINGING`, `DANCE`, `PUBLIC SPEAKING`, `CREATIVE WRITING`, `SPORTS / GAMES`, `DIGITAL SKILLS`, `ARTS AND CRAFTS` (optional) |
  
  ### Consent & Administrative
  
  | Field                 | Type    | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values           |
  |-----------------------|---------|----------|----------------------------------------|
  | safeguardingAgreement | string  | Yes      | One of: `YES`, `NO`                    |
  | mediaConsent          | boolean | Yes      | `true` or `false`. Defaults to `false` |
  | additionalInfo        | string  | No       | Optional free text                     |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`201 Created`** — Returns the newly created volunteer registration record.
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                                         |
  |-----------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Validation failed — missing required fields or invalid enum values. |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                                            |
}
